  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large skillet, caramelize the onions over medium heat for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the broccoli, shredded shio-cured salmon, flour, grated cheese, and a pinch of sugar. Toss to coat evenly.",
    "Add the heavy cream, melted butter, and a dash of nutmeg to the bowl. Toss to coat the broccoli mixture evenly.",
    "Transfer the broccoli mixture to a 9x13-inch baking dish and top with the caramelized onions and breadcrumbs.",
    "Season with salt, pepper, and a pinch of sugar. Mix well to combine.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes or until the top is golden brown and the broccoli is tender.",
    "Remove from the oven and let it rest for 5 minutes before serving."
  ],
